@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

[*] --> Login : [check user]
state Login <<choice>>
Login --> MainArea : [user signs in]
MainArea --> MarketConditions : [select market condition]
MarketConditions --> DisplayMarketReport : [show market report]
MainArea --> PestControlHelp : [select pest control help]
PestControlHelp --> ProvidePhoto : [require photo]
ProvidePhoto --> ShowTechniques : [show techniques]
MainArea --> SoilSuggestions : [provide soil suggestions]
SoilSuggestions --> WeatherInsights : [offer weather insights]
WeatherInsights --> LabourAvailability : [display labour availability]
LabourAvailability --> ContinueService : [continue using service]
ContinueService --> Logout : [log out]

@enduml
